@page "/"

<PageTitle>Purchase Order Manager</PageTitle>

<h1>Purchase Order Manager</h1>

<p class="lead">
    Raise a purchase order against a supplier, add the lines you are buying, then
    receive stock against those lines as it arrives - including when only part of a
    line turns up.
</p>

<div class="home-panel">
    <h2>What it does</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Purchase orders and their line items in a real master-detail relationship.</li>
        <li>Order totals are calculated from the lines, never stored on the order.</li>
        <li>Partial receipts, with the outstanding quantity tracked per line.</li>
        <li>Deleting an order takes its lines with it; a supplier in use cannot be deleted.</li>
    </ul>

    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="purchase-orders">Open purchase orders</a>
</div>
